WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
01 / RECOGNIZE PHISHING
An urgent email is asking you to sign in.
Pause before you click.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
02 / INSPECT THE REQUEST
Unexpected attachment? Unusual sender?
Never share passwords or recovery codes.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
03 / VERIFY SEPARATELY
Open the official app or a trusted bookmark.
Contact the sender using a known channel.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
04 / REPORT AND PROTECT
Report the message to your security team.
Use unique passwords and phishing-resistant MFA.

